## NPM Deployment: Solid Primitives

**Canonical Name:** `@no-comply/solid-primitives`

**Registry:** `https://registry.npmjs.org`

**Access:** `public`

**Prerequisites:**

- Build artifacts exist in `dist/`
- All dependencies published

**Publish Command:** `cd $WORKSPACE/repos/no-comply/libs/solid-primitives && npm publish --access public`
